          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 5,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "Any proceeding under this Act before an income-tax authority shall be deemed to be a judicial proceeding within the meaning of sections 229 and 267 and for the purposes of section 233 of the Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023 (45 of 2023).",
          "children": [],
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-257-1-001",
